# ⚠️ The staged RECORD is 132 MB for four pages and is not committable, which
# is the standing state for records in this repo. Everything DERIVED from it is
# committed -- the file, the system map, the coverage report, the proposals,
# the sheet, the HTML and the crops -- so the artefact opens from a checkout
# and every number in FINDINGS.md can be re-derived without it. What needs the
# record is re-deriving the proposals, and `run_gather.sh` reproduces it.
out/record-*.json
out/*.log
